<h1 align=""center"">Welcome to Social-GPT</h1>
<h3 align=""center"">The Open Source Jasper AI alternative for Social Media</h3>
<p align=""center"">
  <a href=""https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"" target=""_blank"">
