## 3 Quick Start

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/social-media-ai-agent.git
cd social-media-ai-agent
python -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1  # Windows; use source .venv/bin/activate for Linux/Mac
