   ```
   python ingest.py
   ```

6. Run the following command in your terminal to run the app UI (to choose ip and port use --host IP and --port XXXX):
   ```
   chainlit run bot.py -w --host 127.0.0.1 --port 9001
   ```

7. Ask any question about the pdfs"
