lm.py,lm.py,549b832e6e6e11bd7136f83679ef4a42ebbbe2e0,thyeem/lm,https://api.github.com/repositories/956226014/contents/lm.py?ref=21955611d2609f63ddcd04c377f60ef43ae25af8,https://api.github.com/repositories/956226014/git/blobs/549b832e6e6e11bd7136f83679ef4a42ebbbe2e0,https://github.com/thyeem/lm/blob/21955611d2609f63ddcd04c377f60ef43ae25af8/lm.py,A super minimal interface for using language models in terminal,"browser-use, llm-inference, llm-terminal",0,0,0,7,2025-07-21T12:28:38Z,0,0,"# lm

`lm` is a super minimal interface for using _language models_ (LMs) in terminal, including _AI-assisted web browsing_ mode.

## Install

```
$ git clone https://github.com/thyeem/lm
$ cd lm

# build dependencies
$ python -m venv .venv
$ make

# This creates a command in your local bin directory, ~/.local/bin
$ python cmd.sh

# create API-key placeholder 
$ cp .env.examples .env

# Then users need to edit the .env file with their API key credentials.
```

## Interactive shell
```
$ lm 
```
leads you to open `lm` interactive shell. 

```
chat> help
  ls                 List sessions
  rm [KEY..]         Remove sessions
  rename KEY         Rename sessions
  new [NAME]         Create new session
  load [KEY]         Load session
  model [NAME]       Set LLMs to use
  advice [TEXT]      Set advice or directive
  mode               Toggle chat/agent
  chat PROMPT        Run chat
  agent TASK         Run agent
  help               Show this help
  q, quit, exit      Exit the shell
```

## Chat mode 
You can set models, sessions, or directions according to your preferences.   
Run any sub-command individually to see help.  

To submit messages, press `ctrl+d` (the Enter key is assigned for line breaks in multiline input).
```
chat> Find what is the captial city of South Korea.

ASK
Find the captial city of South Korea. 

LLM
The capital city of South Korea is Seoul.

```
## Agent mode 
It opens a browser window (unless headless mode is enabled), starts searching and navigating to find the requested information. Then retrieves and returns the result.  
```
chat> mode
agent> Find the captial city of South Korea.

TASK
Find the captial city of South Korea.

AGENT
... 
(AI-aided browsing starts)
...
```

## In terminal
You can also use the same commands in the terminal outside the `lm` shell.

```
$ lm -h
usage: lm [-h] [-V] [-i]  ...

commands:
  
    ls               list sessions
    rm               remove sessions
    rename           rename sessions
    new              create new session
    load             load session
    model            set LLMs to use
    advice           set advice or directive
    chat             run chat
    agent            run agent

options:
  -h, --help         show this message
  -V, --version      show version information
  -i, --interactive  run in interactive shell mode
```
