                 *******                *                  ***           *******                 
          *******                     **                      ***               *******          
      ****              +----------------------+                 **                    ****      
      *                 | supervisor_condition |**                *                       *      
      *                 +----------------------+* **********      *                       *      
      *            *****            *            *****      **********                    *      
      *       *****                 *                 *****       *   **********          *      
      *    ***                      *                      ***    *             *****     *      
+-----------+                 +---------+                  +-----------+            +----------+ 
| Analyzer |                 | __end__ |                  | Generator |            | Searcher | 
+-----------+                 +---------+                  +-----------+            +----------+ 
````

