> 1. Clone the VIPRAIAssistant repository:
>
> ```console
> $ git clone https://github.com/QsingularityAi/VIPRAIAssistant
> ```
>
> 2. Change to the project directory:
> ```console
> $ cd VIPRAIAssistant
> ```
>
> 3. Install the dependencies:
> ```console
