## Summary

  - ### Frameworks

    - #### Official Version

      - ##### Large Language Model
        ###### 大语言模型（LLM）

        - GPT-1 : ""Improving Language Understanding by Generative Pre-Training"". (**[cs.ubc.ca, 2018](https://www.cs.ubc.ca/~amuham01/LING530/papers/radford2018improving.pdf)**).

